        430.42230224609375,
        438.2276916503906,
        439.6576232910156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "PIMH sampler can be shown to take the following extremely simple form, with ˆpθ.y1:T / as in",
